  "contentHtml": "<p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">비상 교과서에 나오는 마찰전기로 네온전구에 불 켜기 실험 많이들 하시지요? </span></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b30b1a4823619a75e405fa372ab0f43d9c211122\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b30b1a4823619a75e405fa372ab0f43d9c211122\" data-origin-width=\"813\" data-origin-height=\"353\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">스타이로폼 접시를 굳이 구매하지 않더라도 스타이로폼 박스로도 실험이 가능하며 오히려 더 잘 되기에 소개합니다.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/acbaa98779cd1fd5705f32ba999486012a49eae4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/acbaa98779cd1fd5705f32ba999486012a49eae4\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;&#160;&#160;</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
